&lt;p&gt;ISLAMABAD: A quadcopter flown from an unidentified location crash-landed on the rooftop of a house in the capital’s rural area.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Police said that a resident of the house, located in Model Town Humak, informed them about the quadcopter’s crash landing.&lt;/p&gt;
